WEBVTT

03:01.541 --> 03:03.918
Anyway, you don't have a choice.
Robb's waiting.

03:04.043 --> 03:06.963
- I don't want to go.
- Neither do I.

03:07.088 --> 03:08.882
But Robb's Lord of Winterfell,

03:09.007 --> 03:12.010
which means I do what he says,
and you do what I say.

03:13.178 --> 03:15.180
Hodor!

03:18.892 --> 03:21.770
- Hodor?
- Help Bran down the hall.

03:21.895 --> 03:23.897
Hodor.

03:29.944 --> 03:33.448
TYRION: I must say I received
a slightly warmer welcome on my last visit.
